/// requires: db
/// known-gap: vm db_* builtins are not in the VM builtin table
/// known-gap: interp timestamp/timestamptz/date are not decoded (sql_cell_to_value falls through to nil); campfire casts to text to work around it
/// Non-NULL timestamp, timestamptz and date columns do not read as nil.
r | :db_query_one("SELECT '2025-01-02 03:04:05'::timestamp AS ts, '2025-01-02 03:04:05+00'::timestamptz AS tz, '2025-01-02'::date AS d", [])
say(:is_nil(r["ts"]))
say(:is_nil(r["tz"]))
say(:is_nil(r["d"]))
